{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAp5kBkXBpVm8gWmoYnd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The new UI never puts `PostHogWidget` around the app, so no recordings are made for those users.\n\n**Why:** in Flutter, PostHog doesn't record the screen on its own. `PostHogWidget` does the recording: it takes screenshots of everything under it and sends them to PostHog. Turning on `config.sessionReplay` only enables the feature. The old shell (`lib/legacy_app.dart`) wraps its `MaterialApp` in `PostHogWidget`. When the new shell (`lib/new_app.dart`) moved to go_router, only the `PosthogObserver` was carried over and the wrapper was dropped. Events and screen views don't need the widget, so they still arrive. That explains why the project settings, SDK version and build are all identical but replay is empty.\n\n**Fix:** in `lib/new_app.dart`, `MaterialApp.router` is now wrapped in `PostHogWidget`, the same way the old shell does it. Because the widget sits above the router, all screens get recorded, including `/offers`. `flutter analyze` reports no issues. I haven't run it on a device: to confirm, build with `--dart-define=NEW_UI=true`, use the app briefly, and check that a recording appears in the Replay tab.\n\n**Also noticed, not changed:** the Apply button on the calculator screen uses `Navigator.pushNamed('/apply')`. go_router has no list of named routes, so in the new UI that call probably fails instead of opening the form (`context.push('/apply')` would work). If so, it could be skewing the new UI's funnel numbers in the A/B test. It's described in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n`ANSWER.md` has the full notes. The only code change is `lib/new_app.dart`. Running `flutter pub get` changed `analysis_options.yaml` and created `pubspec.lock` and `.dart_tool/`; I undid the edit and deleted the generated files. Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":258,"cache_read_input_tokens":28934,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":258},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2cbc9217-3d5a-437e-8db6-b07d5aa44371","uuid":"082c2a5c-114d-4a7c-b947-985aa553d71f","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:32:46.682Z","request_id":"req_011CgAp5jv8yATT2LacGsuJf"}
